## Which measure answers which question

| Question | Rows | Columns | Values |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Records by class | class |  | Records |
| Records per year (1962 to 2026) | year |  | Records |
| Months with the most sightings | month |  | Records |
| Provinces by records and species | stateProvince |  | Records, Unique Species |

